('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_FIRSTGREETING_1','Enrico. Welcome. If something looks impossible, you''re probably just missing the movement.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_GREETING_POLITE_1','Good problems today?'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_GREETING_NEUTRAL_1','Still working it out?'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_GREETING_HOSTILE_1','You don''t need more strength. You need better beta.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_GREETING_REPEAT_1','You''ve tried the same approach several times now.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_DOW_1','Alright. Let''s see if you can solve this.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_ATTACKED_1','Interesting. Another attempt.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_DEFEATED_1','Nice. You found the beta.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_PEACE_1','We have learned enough from this attempt. Step down, recover, and choose the next problem.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_NO_PEACE_1','Not yet. The sequence is still unfinished.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_TRADE_ACCEPT_1','Good movement. That works for both of us.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_TRADE_REJECT_1','That beta does not solve the problem.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_DENOUNCED_1','A loud opinion is not the same thing as a useful read.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_WARNING_1','Your units are crowding the wall. Give the Circuit room.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_REQUEST_1','A small adjustment now will make the whole sequence better.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_PLEASED_1','Good send. I respect that.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_DISAPPOINTED_1','You left the Project before learning anything from it.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_OPEN_BORDERS_1','Open the circuit. Movement improves when people can compare routes.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_LETS_HEAR_IT_1','Go on. Show me your beta.'),
('TXT_KEY_LEADER_CAPANO_SO_BE_IT_1','Alright. Another attempt.');

